From 57f30dd14aca190d248c101f7379a7347ec12e1f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: qr0n <77075118+qr0n@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 02:11:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 08/12] p100: STRATA_SM60_D20_SUB=1 (IQ4_NL down on the 8-lane
 rows) and STRATA_DOWN_F16=1 (Q2_0 down in fp16)

On sm_60 mode 8 sent both down formats to native_down_lds_kernel. For IQ4_NL the
CUDA layout's 8-lane K=640 rows are faster and bitwise equal (expdec_bench,
20 groups: T=2 92.9 -> 72.5 us, T=4 135.8 -> 90.7). For Q2_0 a new
down_f16_q2_0_kernel: 4 lanes per row (5 calls each, no idle lanes), codes as
subnormal half2 + 16 HFMA2 per call and entry, the -1 offset taken once per
call from the exactly staged sum(q): T=1 39.1 -> 26.8 us, T=4 110.2 -> 62.4,
output rel. RMS 8e-8 vs the int8 path. Both opt-in; expdec_bench choices d20,
d16, all16.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 include/strata/kernels/iq_kernels.hpp |   4 +
 src/kernels/cuda/iq_kernels.cu        | 149 +++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 src/kernels/expdec_bench.cpp          |  13 ++-
 3 files changed, 163 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

